WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:31.350 --> 01:34.040
- Good morning!
- Good morning!

01:34.480 --> 01:36.980
Ice-san, you're looking great!

01:36.980 --> 01:39.310
Let's all eat lunch
together today.

01:40.110 --> 01:42.570
It's been so long
since we've done that.

01:43.780 --> 01:46.540
Hey, are they just gonna
leave us behind?

01:47.120 --> 01:48.620
It can't be helped.

01:48.620 --> 01:52.530
Chocolat's on cloud nine after
making up with Vanilla.

01:54.120 --> 01:57.580
The Queen Final Exam Begins.

02:00.000 --> 02:02.570
Whoa, they've got a new menu!

02:02.920 --> 02:05.800
This spinach and shrimp
quiche looks delicious.

02:06.260 --> 02:08.310
They've got banana
chiffon cake, too!

02:09.550 --> 02:11.350
There's so many I can't decide.

02:11.350 --> 02:12.510
Out of the way.

02:13.310 --> 02:15.850
Commoners must yield
the way, understand?

02:15.850 --> 02:19.030
The likes of you are not allowed
to go before the Members.

02:19.030 --> 02:20.650
Mizutani?

02:20.650 --> 02:21.530
The Members...

02:21.860 --> 02:23.610
I'm not letting you cut!

02:23.610 --> 02:25.030
Who the hell do you think you are?

02:25.030 --> 02:28.700
We, the Members,
are beautiful and superior.

02:28.700 --> 02:32.040
Thus we are entitled to
preferential treatment.

02:32.410 --> 02:34.040
Hey, you gotta respond, too.

02:36.410 --> 02:37.750
It's hopeless!

02:37.750 --> 02:40.470
I'm short, I wear glasses,
and I'm not beautiful at all!

02:40.880 --> 02:43.300
It's only natural that
people'd cut in front of me!

02:44.630 --> 02:45.720
H-Hey!

02:45.720 --> 02:47.470
Where's the need for beauty?

02:50.430 --> 02:52.600
What makes you so great?

02:52.600 --> 02:56.180
The people wearing those pins are
Members from the middle school.

02:57.110 --> 02:59.860
Eh?! They're cutting their way
to the front of the line!

03:00.520 --> 03:03.480
At this rate,
I'll never get my turn.

03:03.480 --> 03:04.480
Chocolat-chan...

03:04.480 --> 03:05.490
Huh?

03:05.490 --> 03:08.660
The Ogres designed those
"Superior Roses."

03:08.660 --> 03:11.950
They give anyone around them
an inferiority complex.

03:13.030 --> 03:16.090
So that's why nobody speaks
up or complains about it.

03:19.290 --> 03:20.250
Yurika?

03:20.250 --> 03:21.580
Chocolat...

03:21.580 --> 03:25.590
You were truly the first person
I wanted to give this to.

03:28.630 --> 03:29.470
To me?

03:29.930 --> 03:31.090
Indeed.

03:31.090 --> 03:34.180
I would only give these pins
to those who deserve them.

03:37.560 --> 03:38.440
Got one for Vanilla?

03:38.850 --> 03:41.900
You think I would give one
to a coward like her?

03:42.360 --> 03:44.400
Here, Chocolat. Take it.

03:56.160 --> 03:57.170
No thanks.

03:57.540 --> 04:00.670
Chocolat, you should think this over.

04:01.170 --> 04:03.630
You think you're better
than everyone else?

04:03.630 --> 04:05.380
No, you are the cowards.

04:07.420 --> 04:09.430
I don't want one, either.

04:09.760 --> 04:11.200
What was that?

04:11.200 --> 04:15.890
I'll never go back to being a coward like you girls ever again.

04:15.890 --> 04:16.940
And don't you forget it!

04:18.020 --> 04:19.020
Vanilla...

04:19.480 --> 04:21.230
Right, Chocolat-chan?

04:21.230 --> 04:21.940
Yeah.

04:21.940 --> 04:23.900
Kato's so awesome!

04:23.900 --> 04:25.900
She told off the Members!

04:26.440 --> 04:28.190
Chocolat's power...

04:28.190 --> 04:30.440
is weakening the Noir.

04:32.780 --> 04:35.870
You got some hearts right
away today, didn't you?

04:35.870 --> 04:37.700
Yeah, just some orange ones.

04:37.700 --> 04:39.330
But I bought an item with them.

04:39.330 --> 04:42.000
Look, it's a Missing Object Ball.

04:42.000 --> 04:46.720
You never fail to buy the items
that're actually useful.

04:47.080 --> 04:49.010
Unlike me...

04:49.550 --> 04:50.880
What is it?

04:50.880 --> 04:53.590
I couldn't get a single heart today.

04:53.590 --> 04:56.350
Aw, isn't that a crying shame.

04:56.350 --> 05:00.220
I'm sure Vanilla-chama would share her ecure with you if she could,

05:00.220 --> 05:02.060
but she can't, so she won't.

05:02.060 --> 05:06.770
Yeah, and she keeps widening
the ecure gap between us.

05:06.770 --> 05:10.570
I don't even want to think
about the Queen Exam.

05:10.570 --> 05:13.700
Well, it's going to happen,
whether you think about it or not.

05:13.700 --> 05:15.160
Grit your teeth and move on.

05:15.160 --> 05:17.040
Is that supposed to cheer me up?

05:19.490 --> 05:20.540
Robin-sensei?

05:21.000 --> 05:23.580
What's going on?
Why so serious?

05:23.580 --> 05:24.870
You two...

05:24.870 --> 05:25.550
What?

05:26.330 --> 05:29.880
The contents of the Queen Final
Exam have been announced.

05:29.880 --> 05:31.300
We're going to Le Royaume.

05:36.470 --> 05:39.180
The long exams
are now at an end.

05:39.720 --> 05:41.810
The next Queen will be selected...

05:41.810 --> 05:44.640
based on the results of this test.

05:44.640 --> 05:46.030
Are you prepared?

05:46.440 --> 05:47.040
Yes.

05:47.400 --> 05:51.150
The Senators will now
give an explanation...

05:51.150 --> 05:53.080
of the Queen Final Exam.

05:53.490 --> 05:56.780
Announcing the contents of
the Queen Final Exam.

05:57.740 --> 05:59.410
The two Queen Candidates...

05:59.410 --> 06:01.700
will travel to the White Mountain,

06:01.700 --> 06:03.910
and obtain the horn of a unicorn,

06:03.910 --> 06:06.050
said to be the only one
in the Magical World.

06:06.460 --> 06:07.870
A unicorn horn?

06:09.170 --> 06:10.550
What the heck is that?

06:11.000 --> 06:14.560
Unicorns are most fussy creatures.

06:14.970 --> 06:16.590
In addition,

06:16.590 --> 06:19.260
they will only bare their souls...

06:19.260 --> 06:21.220
to a girl pure of heart.

06:22.220 --> 06:24.350
If you do not earn
the unicorn's trust,

06:24.350 --> 06:27.030
it will not reveal its true self.

06:27.850 --> 06:31.270
This exam will be a critical test
of your suitability as Queen,

06:31.270 --> 06:35.530
pureness of heart, and
judgment capabilities.

06:36.240 --> 06:38.070
Regardless of what may occur,

06:38.070 --> 06:40.540
please see the examination
through to the end.

06:40.870 --> 06:42.790
Do both of you understand?

06:43.080 --> 06:43.760
Yes.

06:48.670 --> 06:50.500
What was that?

06:50.500 --> 06:54.300
The Queen Final Exam involves
taking a unicorn's horn?

06:55.050 --> 06:58.970
Unicorn horns have great
powers of purification.

06:58.970 --> 07:01.800
If either of the Queen Candidates
acquires a unicorn horn,

07:02.510 --> 07:04.470
it will be most unpleasant for us.

07:05.770 --> 07:06.640
Pierre!

07:07.520 --> 07:08.110
Yes.

07:08.480 --> 07:10.440
Your failure has...

07:10.940 --> 07:14.150
made our situation even more dire.

07:19.740 --> 07:21.070
Pierre...

07:22.070 --> 07:25.740
your fate is now tied to mine.

07:26.290 --> 07:31.460
Surely you've not forgotten your
promise as the Ogre Prince,

07:31.460 --> 07:33.070
to destroy Le Royaume?

07:33.500 --> 07:34.340
No.

07:35.130 --> 07:38.380
If so, I will grant you
one last chance.

07:38.880 --> 07:41.970
Eliminate the Queen Candidates.

07:43.900 --> 07:47.640
It seems I've underestimated
those witches.

07:47.640 --> 07:51.060
Not only did we fail to make either
of them into the Ogre Queen,

07:51.060 --> 07:53.440
but if we leave them
to their own devices,

07:53.440 --> 07:56.580
they will bring calamity
upon us Ogres.

07:59.780 --> 08:01.110
Do you comprehend this, Pierre?

08:01.910 --> 08:05.080
This the last chance
I am giving to you.

08:06.370 --> 08:07.120
Yes.

08:14.710 --> 08:18.250
There's the White Mountain that will
be your final testing grounds.

08:23.430 --> 08:25.600
There's a unicorn on this mountain?

08:26.680 --> 08:29.110
We can't get any closer than this.

08:29.390 --> 08:30.640
Good luck!

08:30.640 --> 08:33.590
I'll be sending power
to you in my prayers.

08:33.980 --> 08:35.190
Thank you.

08:35.190 --> 08:36.120
We'll do our best.

08:36.480 --> 08:38.320
See you when it's done.

08:38.320 --> 08:41.110
Vanilla-chama, I'll be
with you in spirit!

08:41.700 --> 08:43.450
Thank you, Blanca!

08:43.450 --> 08:44.840
See you when it's done, Duke.

08:45.320 --> 08:47.660
Get going, you two.

08:47.660 --> 08:48.410
Okay.

08:53.750 --> 08:55.080
Chocolat-chan?

08:55.080 --> 08:56.630
What is it, Vanilla?

08:56.630 --> 08:59.580
Let's both do our best on
this Final Exam, okay?

09:00.010 --> 09:01.600
Don't hold anything back.

09:01.920 --> 09:02.550
I won't.

09:10.890 --> 09:12.270
It's so high up.

09:12.270 --> 09:12.980
Yeah...

09:16.020 --> 09:18.400
This is the unicorn's mountain.

09:18.400 --> 09:20.660
No one may enter.

09:20.990 --> 09:22.160
Who are you?

09:22.610 --> 09:24.660
I'm the Guardian of this mountain.

09:25.110 --> 09:27.830
We're Queen Candidates.

09:27.830 --> 09:29.880
We're here for
the Queen Final Exam.

09:30.240 --> 09:33.130
Ah yes, I've heard of it.

09:33.710 --> 09:36.460
You're here to take
the unicorn's horn?

09:36.460 --> 09:38.180
It is, of course, impossible.

09:38.590 --> 09:41.170
Don't just say it's impossible!

09:41.170 --> 09:43.470
It'll be okay,
since the unicorn will...

09:43.470 --> 09:47.050
bare his soul for
pure-hearted girls.

09:47.510 --> 09:48.150
Yeah.

09:48.150 --> 09:50.930
Hmm, you're awfully confident.

09:50.930 --> 09:51.900
Fine, then.

09:52.270 --> 09:53.650
I'm getting creeped out here.

09:54.140 --> 09:56.770
Word to the wise: be careful.

09:56.770 --> 09:59.870
When the fog rolls in,
you'll lose all sense of direction.

10:01.570 --> 10:03.860
Ah yes, when that happens,

10:03.860 --> 10:06.360
use this Magical World Compass.

10:08.910 --> 10:10.040
Thank you.

10:10.490 --> 10:12.040
Good luck and good-bye.

10:13.700 --> 10:17.170
Wait! Tell us where the unicorn is!

10:17.170 --> 10:19.130
Hey, wait up a second!

10:19.500 --> 10:20.470
Wait up!

10:20.840 --> 10:23.960
Wait! Hey, wait!

10:23.630 --> 10:25.880
Where'd he go?

10:24.380 --> 10:25.880
Stop running!

10:30.180 --> 10:31.890
He disappeared.

10:31.890 --> 10:33.510
It's a white forest.

10:33.970 --> 10:37.100
It feels like we'll lose track
of where we are.

10:38.060 --> 10:40.030
Let's just get out of
this forest for now.

10:44.940 --> 10:46.820
Thank goodness we made it out!

10:46.820 --> 10:48.450
But the fog's rolled in.

10:48.910 --> 10:49.960
Oh yeah!

10:50.370 --> 10:51.910
Let's give this baby a try.

10:52.410 --> 10:53.590
That thing we just got?

10:59.920 --> 11:00.790
Look!

11:02.460 --> 11:04.630
This path leads to the summit!

11:04.630 --> 11:05.590
You're right!

11:05.590 --> 11:07.810
We might meet the unicorn
if we follow it.

11:08.220 --> 11:09.590
We're off!

11:09.590 --> 11:10.300
Hold up.

11:10.300 --> 11:10.810
What for?

11:11.470 --> 11:14.310
The Magical World Compass
is pointing in a different direction.

11:14.310 --> 11:16.360
Eh? Why?

11:16.810 --> 11:17.890
It says that way!

11:18.890 --> 11:22.310
But, we can see the summit
from this path.

11:23.360 --> 11:25.610
That boy made it a point
to give it to us,

11:25.610 --> 11:28.580
so it might lead to the unicorn.

11:39.160 --> 11:41.330
Let's split up.

11:41.330 --> 11:42.420
Good idea.

11:42.420 --> 11:45.380
That way we can take the
paths we like best.

11:45.960 --> 11:47.670
I'm going this way.

11:48.510 --> 11:50.010
I'll go that way.

11:51.390 --> 11:52.130
See ya later!

11:53.220 --> 11:53.840
Yeah.

11:54.350 --> 11:56.180
You be careful too,
Chocolat-chan.

12:23.290 --> 12:26.630
Why go that way,
when this way's so much easier?

12:28.340 --> 12:31.220
Or maybe this really is
the wrong way?

12:31.220 --> 12:32.930
Now I'm not sure!

12:33.510 --> 12:34.930
Oh yeah!

12:34.930 --> 12:36.510
The Missing Object Ball!

12:36.970 --> 12:39.140
Tell me where to find the unicorn.

12:42.940 --> 12:48.070
So I really should've gone
with Chocolat-chan.

12:48.070 --> 12:50.530
At least we would've
been together.

12:51.370 --> 12:53.900
But this is the Queen Final Exam.

12:54.660 --> 12:56.500
We can't be together forever.

13:01.330 --> 13:03.620
Why's this terrain so difficult?

13:04.420 --> 13:05.880
Maybe this is the wrong way.

13:11.300 --> 13:13.220
Hey, what're you laughing at?

13:13.220 --> 13:15.970
You've got one heck
of a climbing face.

13:15.970 --> 13:21.220
Don't blame me, blame the
compass you gave me!

13:21.680 --> 13:24.450
You really should listen
to what people tell you.

13:24.730 --> 13:25.950
What do you mean?

13:26.350 --> 13:29.940
I told you to use it when you
lose your way in the fog.

13:31.030 --> 13:32.570
If there is no fog,

13:32.570 --> 13:35.950
that compass will show
the wrong direction.

13:36.910 --> 13:38.460
What'd you say?!

13:42.540 --> 13:43.790
H-He's gone.

13:44.620 --> 13:48.880
Do I just go back now, or what?

13:51.550 --> 13:53.470
Well, it'd be faster
to keep going up,

13:53.470 --> 13:55.170
so up I go.

13:59.470 --> 14:00.310
What should I do?

14:00.310 --> 14:02.810
The Missing Object Ball
hasn't returned yet.

14:03.480 --> 14:06.770
You'll never find the unicorn
with something like this.

14:07.810 --> 14:11.000
The unicorn isn't affected
by your magic.

14:12.780 --> 14:16.000
I was unsure about this route,
so I wanted to verify...

14:16.450 --> 14:18.660
This is the path you chose, right?

14:18.660 --> 14:20.990
If you're that unsure,
just go on home.

14:21.620 --> 14:24.000
Have you ever seen the unicorn?

14:24.370 --> 14:27.160
Yes, but not lately.

14:27.710 --> 14:30.750
Not since the Ogres - Royaume
war got worse.

14:31.290 --> 14:33.250
Say, have you seen Chocolat-chan?

14:33.800 --> 14:35.970
By "Chocolat," you mean
that other girl?

14:36.300 --> 14:40.230
Yes, but we split up because she
decided to trust the compass.

14:40.550 --> 14:42.890
You're rivals, aren't you?

14:42.890 --> 14:46.440
What matters more:
your friend, or becoming Queen?

14:48.020 --> 14:50.230
If you want to win against Chocolat,

14:50.770 --> 14:52.320
don't you think...

14:52.320 --> 14:54.950
you should continue on,
without questioning yourself?

14:55.900 --> 14:57.960
I don't see it that way.

14:58.410 --> 15:01.070
Okay, I'll pass that
on to the unicorn.

15:01.070 --> 15:01.990
Wait!

15:02.530 --> 15:04.330
What're you telling the unicorn?

15:04.790 --> 15:05.960
Whatever is that boy?

15:10.380 --> 15:11.750
Chocolat-chan!

15:12.590 --> 15:13.420
Vanilla!

15:15.590 --> 15:18.970
What a relief! I thought I
wouldn't see you again.

15:18.970 --> 15:20.730
You're exaggerating, Vanilla.

15:22.760 --> 15:24.350
But we both...

15:24.350 --> 15:26.520
took different ways, so how...?

15:26.520 --> 15:29.990
This mountain is mysterious,
just like that boy said it was.

15:30.310 --> 15:31.020
Yeah.

15:31.690 --> 15:33.020
So what now?

15:35.440 --> 15:37.440
So, you're together again?

15:37.900 --> 15:40.280
What, you got a problem with that?

15:40.280 --> 15:43.240
Stop playing pranks on us!

15:43.240 --> 15:44.240
Chocolat-chan...

15:44.700 --> 15:46.750
Just give up and go home already.

15:46.750 --> 15:49.500
People like you aren't wanted
on this mountain.

15:50.120 --> 15:53.920
If you offend the unicorn,
I'm the one who gets punished!

15:54.380 --> 15:55.340
"Punished"?

15:55.340 --> 16:00.230
But I heard that the unicorn would show itself to girls with pure hearts.

16:00.720 --> 16:03.510
You think your hearts are pure?

16:03.510 --> 16:05.680
You've come to steal
the unicorn's horn,

16:05.680 --> 16:07.890
just so you can be Queen!

16:07.890 --> 16:10.980
You think that behavior
is befitting a Queen?

16:11.730 --> 16:16.520
Due to the longtime war between
the Ogres and Le Royaume,

16:16.520 --> 16:18.570
our Magical World is in peril.

16:20.530 --> 16:24.120
Do you have the power
to save this world?

16:24.120 --> 16:25.280
Well, we...

16:26.740 --> 16:31.720
I won't claim that we can do it, but we're putting everything we have into trying!

16:32.330 --> 16:35.080
Please, tell that to the unicorn!

16:38.550 --> 16:39.710
Please...

16:41.090 --> 16:42.950
Please do that...

16:44.430 --> 16:46.440
Tell the unicorn yourselves.

16:48.350 --> 16:50.650
There's a small spring
down that path.

16:51.480 --> 16:54.900
The unicorn appears sometimes
to drink from it.

16:56.190 --> 16:57.660
Try going there.

16:58.190 --> 16:59.360
Thank you!

16:59.360 --> 17:01.530
Chocolat-chan, let's check it out!

17:07.330 --> 17:10.370
We just have to stay on the
straight and narrow.

17:10.370 --> 17:11.700
Yeah, let's hurry.

17:13.760 --> 17:14.580
What're these?

17:14.580 --> 17:15.510
It can't be!

17:16.750 --> 17:18.550
I cannot allow you
to go any further.

17:18.960 --> 17:19.960
Pierre!

17:19.960 --> 17:21.380
What're you doing here?

17:21.380 --> 17:23.270
Noir Etoile!

17:23.270 --> 17:24.680
Blizzard of Bubbles!

17:26.590 --> 17:28.390
Brille Etoile!

17:31.600 --> 17:33.350
Pierre, why?

17:33.940 --> 17:37.320
I can't have you ruining
our plans any more.

17:37.690 --> 17:39.440
Wake up, Pierre!

17:39.440 --> 17:41.540
Remember who you really are!

17:42.110 --> 17:44.070
We are enemies,

17:44.070 --> 17:46.200
and nothing can change that!

17:50.480 --> 17:51.090
It's over!

17:51.090 --> 17:52.300
Pierre!!

17:56.710 --> 17:59.880
This pain is tearing my body apart.

18:01.090 --> 18:03.880
Me, kill Chocolat?

18:04.720 --> 18:07.310
There's no way I could do that!

18:15.100 --> 18:15.900
Pierre!

18:16.230 --> 18:16.890
Stay away.

18:19.400 --> 18:21.160
Don't touch me, Chocolat.

18:21.480 --> 18:23.650
But you're hurting so much.

18:28.910 --> 18:31.210
What are the two of you doing?

18:32.580 --> 18:34.920
I'm your enemy.

18:35.460 --> 18:36.660
Defeat me.

18:37.540 --> 18:39.220
Now's your chance!

18:39.540 --> 18:41.420
We can't!

18:41.960 --> 18:44.800
Have you forgotten
how many times...

18:44.800 --> 18:47.470
I've tried to kill you thus far?

18:47.470 --> 18:48.760
Including now.

18:48.760 --> 18:50.470
But you couldn't do it,
could you?

18:52.010 --> 18:54.390
It's because the
real heart inside you...

18:54.390 --> 18:56.950
is telling you not to, Pierre.

18:58.190 --> 18:59.390
You idiot.

19:00.060 --> 19:01.940
This was your last chance.

19:02.860 --> 19:03.820
Chocolat.

19:04.650 --> 19:07.690
Do not underestimate
the power of the Ogres.

19:08.150 --> 19:10.700
Go ahead, defeat me now!

19:11.280 --> 19:13.990
If you don't, who knows
what I'll do...

19:20.000 --> 19:21.680
I just can't do it.

19:22.250 --> 19:24.170
Even if we are really enemies...

19:25.340 --> 19:30.420
I... have feelings for you, Pierre...

19:31.550 --> 19:32.510
Chocolat...

19:37.180 --> 19:41.100
The Noir heart and Pierre's
real heart are fighting!

19:41.100 --> 19:43.310
That's what's hurting him.

19:43.310 --> 19:44.730
Pierre!

19:44.730 --> 19:46.330
That person...

19:46.650 --> 19:48.280
The Grand Duke of Darkness...

19:48.280 --> 19:49.950
is afraid of you two.

19:49.950 --> 19:50.780
Eh?

19:51.530 --> 19:54.620
Continue with the Queen Exam.

19:55.790 --> 19:57.580
That might be the only way...

19:57.580 --> 19:59.910
to save the Magical World.

20:04.090 --> 20:06.710
You two have committed
a grave crime.

20:07.840 --> 20:11.840
These Noir spears have disrupted
the balance of the mountain!

20:14.180 --> 20:17.310
That fragile balance
depended on sacred power.

20:17.850 --> 20:20.060
And this is our fault how?

20:20.060 --> 20:21.060
How?

20:21.060 --> 20:23.350
By leading the
Noir power to this place!

20:23.350 --> 20:25.530
No! It wasn't on purpose!

20:25.820 --> 20:29.240
I doubt the unicorn will
show itself now.

20:48.000 --> 20:49.050
Oh no!

20:49.920 --> 20:51.260
Chocolat-chan!

20:52.970 --> 20:54.260
Are you okay?

20:54.720 --> 20:57.770
Hurry up and get off the
mountain, you two.

20:59.020 --> 21:01.680
He must be incredibly angry...

21:01.680 --> 21:04.350
about what's happened
to this place.

21:04.900 --> 21:08.820
You two might get punished
along with me.

21:10.650 --> 21:14.780
You shouldn't have come
to this mountain after all.

21:14.780 --> 21:16.530
Just give up on
meeting the unicorn,

21:16.530 --> 21:18.490
and return to Le Royaume.

21:18.950 --> 21:22.200
Don't worry about me,
save yourselves!

21:22.790 --> 21:27.340
But we can't just leave you here.

21:27.790 --> 21:30.050
I can't be away from this place.

21:30.050 --> 21:31.560
I'll die.

21:31.960 --> 21:35.060
We also risked our lives to
come to this mountain.

21:35.430 --> 21:37.390
It's for your own good!

21:37.390 --> 21:40.310
Aren't you afraid of the
unicorn's punishment?

21:41.180 --> 21:43.270
I can handle the punishment,

21:43.270 --> 21:45.280
but I won't sacrifice you!

21:47.150 --> 21:49.820
Sorry to make you do this for us,

21:49.820 --> 21:50.530
but...

21:51.530 --> 21:55.240
please tell the unicorn
that we'll accept any punishment!

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:45.990 --> 23:47.650
Unicorn, found you!

23:47.650 --> 23:50.170
Now hand over that horn!

23:50.170 --> 23:51.670
Please, Mr. Unicorn...

23:51.670 --> 23:53.490
...give your horn to me!

23:53.160 --> 23:56.340
Hey, Vanilla, I found him first.

23:56.340 --> 24:01.310
Chocolat-chan, the unicorn will only bare his soul to a pure-hearted girl.

24:01.310 --> 24:02.370
That would be me.

24:02.370 --> 24:04.810
I'm a pure-hearted girl too... aren't I?

24:05.900 --> 24:07.770
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:05.900 --> 24:08.730
Well, there are all different kinds of purity, right?

24:07.770 --> 24:11.130
The Unicorn's Trial, Test of the Heart.

24:08.730 --> 24:11.130
So I've got to fall under at least one of them...

24:11.130 --> 24:12.640
Looks like I'm going to win!

24:13.330 --> 24:14.540
You say something?
